### Travel Booking — REST API + Token
### Works when Aspire is running: dotnet run --project src/aspire/TravelBooking.AppHost
###
### Variables — adjust if your ports differ
@host = http://localhost:5197
@idp  = http://localhost:5001

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Get an access token from IdentityServer
#
#    There is no request for this, on purpose: the
#    only grant this IdP allows is authorization
#    code + PKCE, which needs a browser. The
#    resource owner password grant is removed in
#    OAuth 2.1 and is no longer enabled here.
#
#    Open {{idp}}/Token, sign in as alice/alice123,
#    grant the scopes you want, and paste the token
#    it gives you into @token below.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

@token = paste-your-token-here


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# FLIGHTS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Search flights  AMS → LHR
GET {{host}}/flights?from=AMS&to=LHR&date=2026-12-01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
# After SearchFlights: paste a returned flight id here:
@flightId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Get flight details
GET {{host}}/flights/{{flightId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# BOOKINGS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

###
# After GetFlightDetails: paste an available seat here:
@seatNumber = 12A

### Hold a seat
# @name holdResponse
POST {{host}}/bookings/hold
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "flightId": "{{flightId}}",
  "seatNumber": "{{seatNumber}}"
}

###
@holdId = {{holdResponse.response.body.holdId}}

### Confirm booking
# @name confirmResponse
POST {{host}}/bookings/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "holdId": "{{holdId}}"
}

###
@bookingId = {{confirmResponse.response.body.bookingId}}

### Get booking
GET {{host}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel booking
DELETE {{host}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# ADMIN
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Reset transactional data (no auth required)
POST {{host}}/admin/reset-data

### Health check (no auth required)
GET {{host}}/health
